e primary intent requires complete, directly-verified reporting of all requested fields for the main test workflow (including matrices and exact test command) and identifying a separate docs workflow with its triggers, all verified from YAML. Given the major missing/unsupported components and invented specifics, an average user would not consider the task completed.",
